+It renders an agent task's log (one task, a day, the board), so it lives with the AI system now: the rule is at the top of [ai/readme.md](../../ai/readme.md). This folder is only a pointer, so old links still land somewhere. The move was a script (`Server/ModuleMove.mjs`); its manifest, with every relinked path, is [move-ext-AITask.json](../../ai/sessions/2026/10/13/session-730e8a7b/mastermind-repo-slim/ai-modules-home/move-ext-AITask.json).
